{"id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-dotted-box.md","title":"Provable-and-True Modality","display":"df-dotted-box — Provable-and-True Modality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-dotted-box","aliases":["89-df-dotted-box"],"display":"df-dotted-box — Provable-and-True Modality","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-dotted-box"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-dotted-box</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dotted-box — Provable-and-True Modality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 是下文定义的一元句法缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dotted\\text{-}box}\\vdash\n\\Box^+A\\coloneqq A\\land\\Box A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dotted\\text{-}box}\\vdash\n\\Box^+A\\coloneqq A\\land\\Box A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 8、104；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>原书第 1 章 p.8 已引入带点盒，第 8 章 p.104 再次用于不动点陈述。原书合取次序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\land A\">\\(\\Box A\\land A\\)</span>，本库既有次序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land\\Box A\">\\(A\\land\\Box A\\)</span>；两者命题等价，保留本库写法。\n算术解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau A\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau A\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau A\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau A\\urcorner})\\)</span>，直接使用被解释句子，不引入全局算术真谓词。它不是额外原始模态，也不是仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 的缩写；后续 K4 幂等性和不动点加强条件都依赖当前世界的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 合取项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dotted\\text{-}box}\\vdash\n\\Box^+A\\coloneqq A\\land\\Box A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box A\\land A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\land\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau A\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau A\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1142,"backlinks":[{"id":"3fc95f0f8defc51d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6d8c3016a32d17f8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"251691cede4cbc3e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"16ae22435ebdf5f5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":"